data: {"id": "4144bea4e8074641-thinking-parallel_evidence-1538", "run_id": "4144bea4e8074641", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将基于已采集的 baseline 和 Kubernetes 工具事实，完成 CrashLoopBackOff 根因的证据闭环。\n\n### 第二轮诊断计划\n\n1.  **Kubernetes 状态确认**:\n    *   `kubectl_describe pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07`: 确认最新的事件和状态。\n    *   `kubectl_get_yaml pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07`: 确认容器镜像、入口命令和重启次数。\n2.  **Crash 现场日志**:\n    *   `kubectl logs --previous workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07`: 获取导致上一次退出的应用程序日志（Crash 原因）。\n3.  **Prometheus 最终状态验证**:\n    *   查询 `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 和", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788792644023, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

