data: {"id": "4144bea4e8074641-thinking-parallel_evidence-2884", "run_id": "4144bea4e8074641", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "成功。查询结果表明：\n- 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 返回值为 1\n- 标签显示 `reason=\"CrashLoopBackOff\"`，`container=\"app\"`\n- 时间戳：2026-09-07T14:51:18.022000Z\n\n**结论**：Pod `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 的 app 容器当前仍处于 **CrashLoopBackOff** 等待状态，未恢复。\n\n---\n\n## 本轮已采集事实总结\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 证据 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **Metrics** | **present** | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 返回 1，`reason=\"CrashLoopBackOff\"` |\n\n**关键事实**：\n- Pod 身份确认：UID `bffd1771-cb0a-4bea-96ed-0a46e5b3a923`，节点 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.7`\n-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788792683943, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

